<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Welcome Value Customer</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 40px;">
  <--Tombol style="max-width: 600px; margin: auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); padding: 30px;">
    
    <h1 style="color: #4F46E5;">Welcome to Event App!</h1>
    <p>Hi <strong>{{name}}</strong>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for registering at <strong>Event App</strong>. We are excited to have you join our community of event-goers and organizers.</p>
    <p>You can now explore events, buy tickets, manage your events, and earn rewards by inviting friends!</p>

    <!--Tombol verifikasi -->
      <div style="margin: 30px 0; text-align: center;"> 
        <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" 
          style="background-color: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold;">
          Verify Your Email
        </a>
      </div>

    <p style="margin-top: 20px;">If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email.</p>
    
    <p>Cheers,<br><strong>The Event App Team</strong></p>
    
    <hr style="margin-top: 40px;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #999999;">You are receiving this email because you signed up on Event App.</p>
  
  </div>
</body>
</html>
